Subject: [PATCH 33/35] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: OnePlus 8 Pro compass
 direction, quieter lenses, working OIS

Restore the MMC5603 direction of the vendor device tree, make the stepped lens ramp of the AK7375 optional, and let the LC898128 OIS wait for its firmware between commands.

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
